  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>Matrix&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is symmetric,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is skew symmetric and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is skew symmetric,&nbsp;</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>Now let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>13</mn></msup><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>26</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>26</mn></msup><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>13</mn></msup></math></p><p>Then, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>26</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>26</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>13</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>13</mn></msup><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>26</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>26</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>13</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></mfenced><mn>26</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></mfenced><mn>13</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>26</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>26</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>26</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>M</mi></math></p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math> is skew symmetric</p><p>Now let, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>26</mn></msup><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>26</mn></msup></math></p><p>Then, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>N</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>26</mn></msup><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>13</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>13</mn></msup><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>26</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mi>C</mi></mfenced><mn>13</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mn>26</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>26</mn></msup><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi></math></p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi></math> is symmetric.</p><p>So, only <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></math> is true.</p>",
